      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOLAR HABIT (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from five tries. Missed the frame latest (31.35) when sixth over 531m at this track in a Grade 5. With a clean break looks hard to beat. TOORA TERRY (5) was well in the market last time but only managed fifth (20.02), beaten 5.5 lengths. Finished second the start before. Deserves plenty of respect. CARRY ON CASEY (7) brought up her 17th career win last start at Angle Park (19.35). Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Will go close again if runs up to latest. JOKER'S QUEEN (3) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in her.",
